WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
1966, New York.

2
00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:06.690
A new society is founded to
spread devotion to Krishna.

3
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.440
Its founder is an elderly monk from India,

4
00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:11.320
with almost no money.

5
00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:16.610
Soon, the chanting of Krishna's names
is heard in city streets far from India.

6
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:21.420
Within a few years, the movement has
temples in America and in Britain.

7
00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:26.920
How did one old monk with almost
nothing spread Krishna devotion so far?

8
00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:31.110
In this mission, you'll trace his movement
back to Chaitanya and the chanting

9
00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:32.640
of Krishna's names.

10
00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:37.190
Then you'll weigh up why it grew, and
whether ISKCON is a break from traditional

11
00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:38.420
Hinduism.

12
00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:43.960
Your mission: find out how one elderly monk
took Krishna devotion around the world.
